# The tokenizer assets are SHA256-pinned in sensenova_u15/loader.py
# (TOKENIZER_ASSET_SHA256) and verified on every load. Their bytes must survive
# checkout unchanged, so EOL conversion must never be applied to them --
# otherwise a clone made with core.autocrlf=true (the Git for Windows default)
# rewrites them to CRLF and load_sensenova_clip() fails with
# "SenseNova-U1.5 tokenizer asset digest mismatch".
sensenova_u15/tokenizer/** -text
